            "characterId": "9182fcff-9871-43fe-812d-65f363380173",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_1018",
            "content": {
                "en": "Ah… Veris! Over here.",
                "zh": "啊......以真！这边。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 472.0,
            "positionY": 120.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "77c5dc93-0be0-40fd-b88e-e20ed0a96f04",
            "index": 1,
            "characterId": "066100ef-5e3a-4a3f-8313-9da8c2998323",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_1019",
            "content": {
                "en": "!",
                "zh": "！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 807.3333740234375,
            "positionY": 122.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "9770f865-01ab-4c52-bc27-cf810934f02b",
            "index": 2,
            "characterId": "c5690423-74d1-4bca-8967-89da828b1a25",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_1020",
            "content": {
                "en": "Noema, long time no see…",
                "zh": "梦之，好久不见……",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1144.0,
            "positionY": 128.6666717529297,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "b2b2bc19-d800-4e83-b2ae-5bee5592599a",
            "index": 3,
            "characterId": "5c2350da-c9c0-447f-8406-60bff21a53f5",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_1021",
            "content": {
                "en": "Yeah. Sorry I haven’t contacted you for so long—especially when we promised we would after graduation.",
                "zh": "是啊。抱歉，这么久都没有联系你，明明之前毕业时说好了的。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1484.0,
            "positionY": 132.6666717529297,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "23fd413e-e66e-4905-8246-06f3b759dbe6",
            "index": 4,
            "characterId": "c5690423-74d1-4bca-8967-89da828b1a25",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_1022",
            "content": {
                "en": "No… it’s not like that. I’m really happy to see you.",
                "zh": "不......没有的事，见到你我很开心。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1828.6666259765625,
            "positionY": 132.6666717529297,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "14cea158-93e6-436b-ba9a-6724e0a8ec2f",
            "index": 5,
            "characterId": "7324b771-f6f5-4d90-b605-0ae0697e44d9",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_1023",
            "content": {
                "en": "Oh, right. You just got here yesterday, didn’t you? How was your rest?",
                "zh": "啊，对了。你昨天刚到吧？休息的怎么样。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2166.666748046875,
            "positionY": 134.6666717529297,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "1595e599-e651-44c0-8e41-f5c623017219",
            "index": 6,
            "characterId": "d5be2dcf-87aa-4ebc-afce-674209069707",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_1024",
            "content": {
                "en": "(How should I bring up what happened on the plane?)",
                "zh": "（我该怎么跟她提起飞机上的事呢？）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2506.0,
            "positionY": 134.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "ce6f3c62-52ef-445c-8059-593674a2ef8d",
            "index": 7,
            "characterId": "d5be2dcf-87aa-4ebc-afce-674209069707",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_1025",
            "content": {
                "en": "(…Forget it. I’ll talk about it later.)",
                "zh": "（算了，之后再说吧。）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2840.666748046875,
            "positionY": 131.3333282470703,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "9954b7c9-ba08-4b1d-862d-661e16cf128d",
            "index": 8,
            "characterId": "c5690423-74d1-4bca-8967-89da828b1a25",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_1026",
            "content": {
                "en": "I rested pretty well. How have things been in Yuntai? I heard it hasn’t been peaceful lately.",
                "zh": "我休息的挺好的，你在芸台过得怎么样？我听说这里近来不太平。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3188.666748046875,
            "positionY": 130.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "3dd30f8b-b16a-4d78-a88e-484afd958840",
            "index": 9,
            "characterId": "5c2350da-c9c0-447f-8406-60bff21a53f5",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_1027",
            "content": {
                "en": "Haha, it’s been okay. Yuntai was never all that stable to begin with.",
                "zh": "哈哈，还好。芸台其实一直都不算多安稳。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3529.33349609375,
            "positionY": 133.3333282470703,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "f9b17698-b6d4-4040-b59d-83a654ae0364",
            "index": 10,
            "characterId": "e3614b9a-4789-4305-ac57-4a6bac607584",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_1028",
            "content": {
                "en": "I really miss those days with you back in Wenqiu.",
                "zh": "真想念当时和你一起在纹秋的日子啊。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3876.666748046875,
            "positionY": 138.6666717529297,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
